+    "value": "Consider this description of the dagger blade showing a hunting scene from Grave Circle A:\n\n'Across the blade, four hunters confront a lion. One has fallen, while the others carry spears, shields and a bow. The design is created by inlaying different metals into the bronze so that the scene stands out in vivid contrast.'\n\nWhat does this object tell us about the Mycenaeans? Use details from the description and your own knowledge in your answer.",
